  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening conservation of the northern yellow-cheeked gibbon Nomascus annamensis..and the establishment of community-based monitoring group on the eastern slope of the Central..Annamites, Vietnam.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to provide accurate information on the status of the gibbons of this region, encourage involvement of local people in gibbon monitoring and conservation, and facilitate establishment of new protected areas in the region. This will be done by: 1) establishing community-based monitoring and patrol teams; 2) providing training on gibbon survey techniques; 3) estimating the population size of gibbons and identifying key sites for conservation of gibbons and other endangered primates; 4) providing training on identification of globally threatened and most commonly traded species in the region; and 5) conducting an awareness raising program in secondary schools and villages in two districts.</narrative>
  </description>
